  monitoring:{methodsFull:['auc_bayes','auc_2level'], timingFull:['early','ss'],
    idealText:'A level roughly 24&ndash;48 hours after the loading dose to decide when to redose, then AUC-guided monitoring.'},
  reasoning:`<ol>
    <li>CrCl &asymp; 16 mL/min, stable. Cockcroft-Gault is usable here because his creatinine is not
    moving.</li>
    <li>The loading dose is unchanged: 25 &times; 74 &asymp; <b>1,850 mg</b>. His kidneys govern how
