  crclNote:'Creatinine clearance is not a meaningful concept in an anuric dialysis patient.',
  vignette:`<p>A 58-year-old woman with end-stage renal disease has been on intermittent hemodialysis
    Monday/Wednesday/Friday for four years through an arteriovenous graft. She is admitted on a
    Tuesday with fever and a tender, erythematous graft; blood cultures are positive for MRSA.</p>
    <p>She is anuric. Today's creatinine is 7.1 mg/dL pre-dialysis. Her next scheduled session is
