    <li>Maintenance runs about 15&ndash;20 mg/kg/day on CRRT, so roughly 1,350&ndash;1,800 mg/day:
    <b>750&ndash;1,000 mg q12h</b>, or 1,500 mg q24h.</li>
    <li>Check a level at around 24 hours, and re-check after any change to the CRRT prescription
